==Belarusian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|be|sla-pro|*čьto}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|be}} {{m|ine-pro|*kʷid}}, {{m|ine-pro|*kʷis}}. Cognates include {{etyl|uk|-}} {{term|що|lang=uk}}, {{etyl|ru|-}} {{term|что|lang=ru}} and {{etyl|pl|-}} {{term|co|lang=pl}}.

===Conjunction===
{{head|be|conjunction|tr=što}}

# [[that]]

===Pronoun===
{{head|be|pronoun|tr=što}}

# {{non-gloss definition|relative pronoun}}: [[that]], [[which]]
# {{non-gloss definition|interrogative pronoun}}: [[what]]

