From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*čьto||what}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*kʷid}}, compare {{m|ine-pro|*kʷis}}; compare Čakavian {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|ча̏||what}} (from {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{m|sla-pro|*čь}}).

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|шта̏}} (pronoun only)

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃtô/|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=што̏|c|što|štȍ}}

# [[why]] (short for {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|за̏што}})
